  "payload": {
    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-status\"><header><strong>Sharbel</strong></header><div class=\"tw-body\"><br>100 天与 Hermes 代理（21 分钟）<br><br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=0\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">00:00</span></a>  使用 Hermes 与实际操作 Hermes 之间的差距<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=52\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">00:52</span></a>  错误 1：像使用更智能的搜索框一样使用 Hermes<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=90\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">01:30</span></a>  将提示转化为可重复循环<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=193\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">03:13</span></a>  如何在调度之前手动构建工作流<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=233\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">03:53</span></a>  Cron 任务和计划任务解释<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=312\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">05:12</span></a>  错误 2：将所有内容都放在一个杂乱的聊天中<br>Telegram 话题作为单独的工作区<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=470\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">07:50</span></a>  我推荐的 3 个工作区设置<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=520\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">08:40</span></a>  错误 3：让一个代理做所有事情<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=573\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">09:33</span></a>  子代理如何让 Hermes 更简洁、更实用<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=687\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">11:27</span></a>  Nova 和 Sage，我的专业特工<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=786\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">13:06</span></a>  错误 4：等待手动触发 Hermes<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=831\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">13:51</span></a>  通过 Notion 内容看板示例解释 Webhooks<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=952\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">15:52</span></a>  轮询 cron 任务讲解<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=1012\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">16:52</span></a>  错误 5：永远通过聊天管理一切<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=1040\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">17:20</span></a>  构建一个 Hermes 任务控制仪表盘<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=1144\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">19:04</span></a>  我从头开始构建 Hermes 的确切顺序<br> <a style=\"color: rgb(29, 155, 240);\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1loqt21\" role=\"link\" href=\"/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785?t=1200\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">20:00</span></a>  如何开始而不做过度构建</div><div class=\"tw-images\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2067228265777958912/img/5bCFWReoklyTHx7P.jpg\" alt=\"图片\" /></div><div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2067228265777958912/img/5bCFWReoklyTHx7P.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div></article>",
    "pageContent": "Sharbel: 100 天与 Hermes 代理（21 分钟） 00:00 使用 Hermes 与实际操作 Hermes 之间的差距 00:52 错误 1：像使用更智能的搜索框一样使用 Hermes 01:30 将提示转化为可重复循环 03:13 如何在调度之前手动构建工作流 03:53 Cron 任务和计划任务解释 05:12 错误 2：将所有内容都放在一个杂乱的聊天中\nTelegram 话题作为单独的工作区 07:50 我推荐的 3 个工作区设置 08:40 错误 3：让一个代理做所有事情 09:33 子代理如何让 Hermes 更简洁、更实用 11:27 Nova 和 Sage，我的专业特工 13:06 错误 4：等待手动触发 Hermes 13:51 通过 Notion 内容看板示例解释 Webhooks 15:52 轮询 cron 任务讲解 16:52 错误 5：永远通过聊天管理一切 17:20 构建一个 Hermes 任务控制仪表盘 19:04 我从头开始构建 Hermes 的确切顺序 20:00 如何开始而不做过度构建\n![图片](https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2067228265777958912/img/5bCFWReoklyTHx7P.jpg)\n[![视频](https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2067228265777958912/img/5bCFWReoklyTHx7P.jpg)](https://x.com/sharbel/status/2067257256215789785)"
